are you ready to learn a bunch of facts  about demon slayer that you probably  didn't know of course you are let's get  started demon slayer's creator kiyoharu  gotoge remains anonymous to the public  gotogh's biological gender also remains  unknown but it's believed that the  creator of the demon slayer is a female  the hashida are the most powerful  members of the demon slayer core and  there are only nine of them to become  one a demon slayer needs to kill at  least 50 demons or one of the demon  moons that belong to the 12 kazuki  rengoku's favorite food is sweet  potatoes giome is the only known demon  slayer that doesn't use an actual blade  he's also blind due to a fever he had as  a child muzan kibutsuji is around 1 000  years old the demon slayer mark appears  on demon slayers after experiencing  life-threatening conditions tanjido's  awakened after he was attacked by a  demon called gyutero the marks look like  tattoos or scars and grant the bear  extra abilities to help them in battle  people who awaken the demon's layer mark  usually die by the age of 25. tengen and  inosuke are the only demon slayers that  use two nichiren blades instead of one  muichiro tokito is the youngest hashira  in the demon slayer core being only 14  years old gyomehimejima is the oldest  hashira even though he's only 27 years  old all other hashida's ages range from  18 to 23 demon slayer mugen train movie  is the highest grossing anime movie of  all time making just over 500 million  dollars it became the highest grossing  japanese movie of all time and even  became the first non-hollywood movie  topping the annual box office  gyomehimejima is the tallest character  in the demon slayer universe being 2.20  meters tall frengoku became hashida by  killing lower moon rank 2 demon at the  time ringoku's ninth form dragon was  anime original and did not appear in the  manga the only confirmed human to  survive above the age of 25 while having  a demon slayer mark was yorichi he was  also the first breathing style user the  literal translation of the name tanjiro  is high-valued second sun while kamado  translates to the stove mitsuri's hair  is said to be pink because of her eating  too much sakura mochi the anime makes it  clear that tanjuro has a keen sense of  smell however one tiny detail most fans  didn't notice is that tangido is able to  smell underground as shown when he was  tracking swamp demon tanjido is his own  barber we could see early in the show  that he gives himself a haircut the  movie's title was supposed to be  infinite train instead of mujintrain  however it was changed to avoid issues  with the cartoon named infinity train  that was shown on the cartoon network  the voice actor of nezuko akarikito has  the exact same height as nezuko five  feet the average budget for a single  episode of demon slayer is around eighty  thousand dollars the hashidas are the  best of the best when it comes to demon  slaying which is why they not only  possess their very own unique breathing  styles but their own territories to  protect every single hashida is given  authority over a specific region or area  in which they not only have to protect  people from demon attacks but also  gather intel on the demons residing  there nezuko tamayo and yushiro are the  only demons in the entire show not under  the influence of muzan muzan has seven  hearts and five brains meaning  decapitating him would not kill him he  also has the ability to absorb people's  cellular memories muzan baby form is  equal to the three-floor building  rengoku's voice actor hatoshikino is an  excellent swordsman in real life as well  like any other organization in the world  the demon slayer corps has a strict  hierarchy the newest demon slayer is  always allotted the mizunoto rank by  default which is the lowest rank from  that they have to train hard practice  their breathing styles and kill demons  in order to progress to various other  upper ranks the highest rank allotted to  anyone in the organization is called the  kino tanjido has very rough hands this  is a small detail that's mentioned only  for a few seconds in the anime something  many fans probably missed ever since  tanjido decided to become a demon slayer  he had to find a master and undergo  strict training it's been noted that his  master sakonji urokodaki's tough  training resulted in tanjido's hands  becoming rougher the breath of sun is  the first breathing style ever created  and all other breathing styles are  derived from it as the result of yorichi  the creator of sun breathing modifying  it to suit the individuals he taught  tanjido was banned from a specific  hashida training activity this occurs  during the hashida training arc when the  demon slayer manga the hashida training  program as the name suggests is the  program for demon slayers to participate  in tanjido manages to finish every  course he participates in except one and  that is the win hashida's course who  have banned him for attacking one of  their own genya tanjido's face scar  completely changes during the final  selection how many of you noticed that  although it's not stated explicitly the  manga implies heavily that muzan and  kagaya are related to each other kagaya  says that his bloodline was cursed  because of a demon that came from it  this demon was the original demon which  would mean the first of its kind fans  know that muzen is the first demon ever  so it makes sense that muzan comes from  the obuyashiki's bloodline akaza is the  only upper moon that people got to see  in the anime so far he is one of the  most interesting demons and the only one  that fights completely bare-handed fire  plays an important part in the commodore  family they respected fire and we see  their father during a flashback perform  a traditional dance in a ring of torches  on new year's day this may go some way  in explaining why both the siblings have  firebase powers with nizuko able to  manipulate demonic flames from her blood  that don't hurt humans tanjido wears a  pair of hanafuda earrings that he  inherited from his father when muzan  kabutsuji the serious villain sees  tanjido's earrings he sends two of his  subordinates after the young demon  slayer muzan had a near-death encounter  with a demon slayer who wore those same  earrings and that's why he's so scared  of tanjiro and wants him dead before  tengen uzui became a demon slayer and  then  he was originally a shinobi muichiro  tokito is a descendant of kokushibo he  possesses the strongest bloodline and  has the ability to surpass every hashida  in the current generation once  urokodaki's students complete their  training he carves them a fox theme  warding mask to wear during their final  selection each mask has a different  design that is unique to the wear  sabito's mask had a pale scar in the  same spot as the scar on his cheek while  makomo's mask had flowers that reflected  the flowers on her kimono tanjiro's mask  has a red sun-shaped symbol over his  scar the color and shape of this symbol  resemble the design on tanjiro's  hanafuda earrings too in japan the name  of the show is kimetsu no yaiba which  literally translates to demon killing  blade demon slayer manga already ended  and it sold over 150 million copies  worldwide muzan kobutsuji creates demons  using his blood if a demon happens to  show potential muzan will share more of  his blood with that demon blessing it  with even more power the 12 strongest of  these demons make up the 12 kazuki  however if a kazuki reaches its limit  they become useless to muzan and have  their title and number stripped the  demon kyogai is a prime example kagaya  is the 97th leader of the demon slayer  corps he was only four years old when he  was granted the title muzan can't  tolerate being called pale or dead after  his initial encounter with tanjido muzan  bumps into three drunk humans then one  of the drunks comments on muzan's pale  skin and how he looks ready to fall over  dead suddenly muzan's demeanor changes  his eyes flash in irritation and anger  and he kills the group without remorse  or hesitation his strong reaction is a  result of his fear of death he devotes  his life to making himself immortal and  cannot stand the thought of dying or  being limited in any way yorichi is  easily the most powerful demon slayer to  ever live he comes the closest to  killing muzan single-handedly making the  demon hide from him for the rest of his  life despite the fact that the hashida  did exist at that point in time and that  yorici fought alongside them he is never  confirmed to have been one himself if he  was he wasn't one for long as the  hashida rejected him after his brother  became a demon and he failed to kill  muzan muzen is obsessed with finding the  blue spider lily as it's an essential  item that would allow him to walk in the  sunlight despite creating a large number  of demons and having his best  subordinates constantly on the lookout  for the plant no one was ever able to  locate it the reason for this is that  the blue spider lily only blooms at day  time two or three days a year and then  it closes back up resembling that of a  big horsetail weed click on this video  where we cover all things you missed in  attack on titan

